{
  "name": "forge_ape",
  "_template": "Great ape archetype (ape, baboon, giant ape via binding tint+scale). It was built as a generic quadruped and read as one: a dog's long neck and muzzle, a level back, and A TAIL -- great apes are tailless, and that alone breaks the silhouette. Rebuilt around what actually says 'ape': shoulders HIGH above the hips with the back sloping down to the rump, a short neck with the head sunk between the shoulders, a heavy brow over a short projecting jaw (not a snout), very long thick forelimbs knuckling the ground, and short crouched hind legs. Neutral dark palette authored FOR tinting.",
